=== Quickshell config update for user QML path ===
User needs to either:
  1. Run quickshell with QML2_IMPORT_PATH=/home/eunoia/.local/share/qt6/qml
  2. Or run: sudo cp -r /home/eunoia/.local/share/qt6/qml/Clavis /usr/lib/qt6/qml/
  3. Or add 'export QML2_IMPORT_PATH=/home/eunoia/.local/share/qt6/qml' to shell rc
